{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>BetterCast 是一款專為重度 Podcast 聽眾打造的播放器，今天限時免費中。它徹底消滅了廣告干擾，讓你能專注於優質內容。無論你是通勤族、運動愛好者還是知識吸收狂，都能透過強大的播放控制與裝置端轉錄功能，提升收聽效率。</p>\n\n<h2>裝置端轉錄智慧跳過</h2>\n<p>支援播放速度調整、靜音略過與章節標記，讓收聽節奏隨心所欲。獨家裝置端轉錄功能可自動生成文字，並依關鍵字設定規則跳過開場或廣告。打造個人化播放清單，篩選條件包括關鍵字、主題與時長。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-72-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-73-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-74-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-75-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-76-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-77-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>BetterCast 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：BetterCast – 播客播放器</li>\n<li>應用類別：News</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-09T04:16:23.931663+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}